# AT-FOLDERS round 6: an `@` folder pasted whole, so the list's episode opens
# on the folder's query -- its listing, no walk of the index -- and then a
# Backspace turns it back into an indexed query, whose change of kind asks
# for the index's refresh (fx `file_completion_state.zig:164@481104fd`).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
work p5-input-at-folders-ws
wait 4
paste @src/
wait 1.2
snap paste-src
key BSpace
wait 1.5
snap paste-src-back
